# Kamen

Live avatar local (ASR + LLM + TTS + lipsync + VLM) para Jetson Thor.
Foco: baixa latencia, 25-30 FPS, PT-BR, open source.

Documentos principais:
- docs/live-avatar-jetson-thor.md
- docs/implementation-plan.md
- docs/services.md
- docs/assets-prep.md
- docs/test-plan.md
- docs/runbook.md
- docs/dependencies.md

Configs e contratos:
- proto/avatar.proto
- configs/stack/default.yaml
- configs/stack/mock.yaml
- configs/personas/ana.yaml

Quick start (mock services):
1) pip install -r requirements.txt
2) ./scripts/gen_proto.sh
3) export PYTHONPATH=/workspace/src
4) python -m avatar.mock_services --port 50051

LLM service (stub with tool-call support):
1) pip install -r requirements.txt
2) ./scripts/gen_proto.sh
3) export PYTHONPATH=/workspace/src
4) python -m avatar.llm_service --port 50052 --persona-id ana --stack /workspace/configs/stack/mock.yaml

End-to-end test (orchestrator):
1) export PYTHONPATH=/workspace/src
2) python -m avatar.orchestrator --text "ola mundo" --out-wav /tmp/out.wav --stack /workspace/configs/stack/mock.yaml

Service commands (stubs/placeholder backends):
- ASR: python -m avatar.asr_service --port 50051 --persona-id ana
- LLM: python -m avatar.llm_service --port 50052 --persona-id ana
- TTS: python -m avatar.tts_service --port 50053 --persona-id ana
- Lipsync: python -m avatar.lipsync_service --port 50054 --persona-id ana
- VLM: python -m avatar.vlm_service --port 50055 --persona-id ana
